### VROS - Keycloak Authentication & Authorization
### Requires: docker compose up db keycloak
### Keycloak admin console: http://localhost:8081 (admin / admin)

@keycloak = http://localhost:8081
@realm = vros
@api = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Authenticate as ADMIN via Keycloak Token Endpoint
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=vros-api&username=admin_user&password=admin123!&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 2. Authenticate as CUSTOMER via Keycloak Token Endpoint
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=vros-api&username=customer_user&password=customer123!&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 3. Authenticate as DRIVER via Keycloak Token Endpoint
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=vros-api&username=driver_user&password=driver123!&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("driverToken", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 4. Admin Access: List All Customers (Allowed -> 200)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Customer Access: Attempt to List All Customers (Expects 403 Forbidden)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Anonymous Access: Attempt to Create Delivery (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "quantity": 100
}

### 7. Current User: Get Synchronized Profile (Any authenticated role)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Customer Self-Service Onboarding (ROLE_CUSTOMER only)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/users/me/customer-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "VROS Customer",
  "email": "customer@vros.com",
  "phone": "+40744112233",
  "address": "Strada Lipscani 21, Bucuresti",
  "lat": 44.4312,
  "lng": 26.1018
}

### 9. Driver Access: List Assigned Vehicle Fleet (Allowed -> 200)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Customer Access: Attempt to List Vehicles (Expects 403 Forbidden)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Admin Access: List All Deliveries (Allowed -> 200)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Expired / Malformed Token (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer not-a-valid-jwt
Accept: application/json
